/*!
    \module CollectionNoCmakeInfo
    \title Collection Without CMake Info
    \brief A module whose qdocconf sets no CMake or qmake package info.

    This module intentionally omits \c{\\cmakepackage}, \c{\\cmakecomponent},
    and \c{\\qtvariable} to reproduce the IR field absence that previously
    caused an Inja render_error (surfaced as SIGABRT) in the TemplateGenerator
    when rendering collection pages for modules such as QtQuickTest.
*/
